Operator dnsmasq options for the HaLow DHCP server.

start.py runs one dnsmasq for every mode that serves leases (AP, the relay's
AP leg, a mesh portal, br0 in DHCP-server mode). Its configuration is
generated at /run/halow/dnsmasq.conf and includes this directory, so *.conf
files placed here survive a restart and a package update.

  dhcp-option=6,192.168.200.1      # DNS server handed to clients
  dhcp-host=8c:0f:fa:00:29:46,192.168.200.20
  log-dhcp

The generated file sets interface=, dhcp-range=, the lease file and DNS
forwarding; do not repeat those here.
